sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User / Knowledge UI
  participant K as Knowledge owner
  participant H as Handoff owner
  participant W as Worker
  participant A as Fixed binding + tenant map
  participant D as Service Desk owner
  U->>K: Save authorized text
  K->>K: Commit document + indexing job
  U->>H: Request linked Service Desk action
  H->>K: Read permitted source through public contract
  H->>H: Commit relationship + delivery job
  W->>H: Claim one attempt
  W->>A: Same original command identity
  A->>D: Mapped tenant + destination service identity
  D->>D: Reauthorize + commit record and receipt
  D-->>W: Original committed receipt
  W->>H: Fenced commit of relationship outcome
  Note over W,D: Lost response retries the same identity; no cross-store transaction
